  "description": "Miguel Smajli Benztown Mint Colorway Subrosa rider Miguel Smajili hails from Stuttgart Germany and has always had a taste for the finer things. From his early years he would fascinate over the luxury cars that were all too familiar due to his hometown being in the heart of the German automobile industry. When it came time to start on his guest color way of the “Simo” Frame, Miguel already had the color and theme in his mind. Based off the classic 50’s era Mercedes Benz roadsters designed to look classy, fast, and ooze luxury, the “Benztown Mint” color does just that, and the chrome dripped decals also link you away to Miguel’s Spotify to get down with his other passion of rap music.\n\nWeight: 4.8 lbs for 20.5”",
